---
import "../styles/global.css";
import { ClientRouter } from "astro:transitions";
---

<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>About | Bagus Wicaksono</title>

    <ClientRouter />

    <style>
      @keyframes blob {
        0% {
          transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1);
        }
        33% {
          transform: translate(30px, -50px) scale(1.1);
        }
        66% {
          transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.9);
        }
        100% {
          transform: translate(0px, 0px) scale(1);
        }
      }
      .animate-blob {
        animation: blob 7s infinite;
      }
      .animation-delay-2000 {
        animation-delay: 2s;
      }
      .animation-delay-4000 {
        animation-delay: 4s;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body
    class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-emerald-500 selection:text-white relative min-h-screen flex flex-col"
  >
    <div
      transition:persist="background"
      class="fixed inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-600 rounded-full mix-blend-screen filter blur-[128px] opacity-30 animate-blob"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute top-[20%] right-[-10%] w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600 rounded-full mix-blend-screen filter blur-[128px] opacity-30 animate-blob animation-delay-2000"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute bottom-[-20%] left-[20%] w-96 h-96 bg-teal-600 rounded-full mix-blend-screen filter blur-[128px] opacity-30 animate-blob animation-delay-4000"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <header
      class="sticky top-0 z-50 w-full bg-gray-900/60 backdrop-blur-md transition-all"
    >
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex justify-end">
        <nav class="flex space-x-6 text-sm font-medium">
          <a href="/myweb/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition"
            >Home</a
          >
          <a
            href="/myweb/about"
            class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition">About</a
          >
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- KONTAINER UTAMA -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full relative z-10 flex flex-col grow mt-8">
      <main class="space-y-12 grow px-6 pb-20">
        <header>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4">
            Halo, saya <span class="text-emerald-400">Bagus Wicaksono.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Saya adalah lulusan Teknik Informatika di Universitas Pamulang yang
            bersemangat dalam pengembangan perangkat lunak. Meskipun menggunakan
            AI sebagai asisten saya, saya dapat memahami sekaligus jadi metode
            pembelajaran yang efektif. Saya berusaha dalam membangun aplikasi
            web dan android. Saya berkomitmen untuk terus belajar dan
            beradaptasi dengan teknologi terbaru, serta berkontribusi pada
            proyek yang inovatif dan bermanfaat bagi saya sendiri dan sekitar.
          </p>
        </header>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 border-b border-gray-700 pb-2">
            Metodologi & Pendekatan
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Dalam mengembangkan software, saya sangat mengedepankan fundamental
            yang kuat. Saya terbiasa merancang arsitektur aplikasi (<em
              >clean architecture</em
            >), melakukan normalisasi <em>database</em>, serta menerapkan siklus
            pengembangan dengan<strong class="text-gray-200"> metode </strong>
            yang dibutuhkan secara aktif.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 border-b border-gray-700 pb-2">
            Apa yang saya pelajari
          </h2>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
            <span
              class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 text-emerald-400 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-700 transition cursor-default"
              >Astro</span
            >
            <span
              class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 text-emerald-400 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-700 transition cursor-default"
              >Flutter</span
            >
            <span
              class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 text-emerald-400 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-700 transition cursor-default"
              >HTML/CSS</span
            >
            <span
              class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 text-emerald-400 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-700 transition cursor-default"
              >Java</span
            >
            <span
              class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 text-emerald-400 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-700 transition cursor-default"
              >Git / GitHub</span
            >
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm italic flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg
              class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            Developer belum bersertifikasi di platform Dicoding.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 border-b border-gray-700 pb-2">
            Di Luar Pengkodean
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            Saya senang eksplorasi internet, mengenai tren <em>AI</em> maupun tutorial
            dari <em>Youtube</em>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
